  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2015-2026 Chevy Colorado/GMC Canyon Crew Cab\nFeatures\nCompatibility: YITAMOTOR running boards are compatible with 2015 2016 2017 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 Chevy Colorado/GMC Canyon Crew Cab (Please check the cab size picture if you are unsure of your exact model )\nUnique Split Design: Unlike traditional full-length running boards, our innovative 4-piece independent split design offers a rugged, modern off-road look allow flexible installation and individual replacement if needed\nReliable Non‑Slip Traction: Features an aggressive hexagonal mesh surface for strong slip resistance in rain, snow and mud, offering secure footing for you and your passengers\nGreat Quality: Made with stainless steel that outperforms ordinary steel in rust resistance and durability, Combined with tough ABS step pads. After repeated tests, they can resist the corrosion of salt spray, and withstand UV radiation without discoloration.Each side can handle up to 440 lbs\nEasy Installation: Package includes a set of 4 split steps (left and right), No drilling is required as it uses original hole positions for installation. The welded brackets provide additional strength Note: The brackets are not pre-welded to the step bar; Ensure the boards match your vehicle\nProfessional installation recommended",
